    + exact run_ovf_1RB1LA_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_1RA1LC.
    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LA_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_1RA1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LA_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_1RA1LC p j' E).
