Proof.
  intros p q0 E. destruct (KpCounter.cview_some_K p 0 q0 E) as (H1 & H2).
  unfold Cc_1RB1LA_0LC0RB_1RA0LD_1LA1LD, cden, Z0_1RB1LA_0LC0RB_1RA0LD_1LA1LD, Z1_1RB1LA_0LC0RB_1RA0LD_1LA1LD; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
