Module LAPT_1RB1LA_0LC1RB_1RA1LD_1LC0RB.
(** * LAPT_1RB1LA_0LC1RB_1RA1LD_1LC0RB: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1LA_0LC1RB_1RA1LD_1LC0RB, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

